<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="640" class="st-wrapper st-wrapper-background st-module-wrapper-table" style="width: 640px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" bgcolor="#FFFFFF" valign="top" style="width: 100%; padding-right: 39px; padding-left: 41px;"> 
<table role="presentation" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" align="center" width="100%" style="width: 100%;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left"> 
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" width="560" class="st-mso-full-width st-mobile-full-width" style="width: 560px;"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td align="center" valign="top" width="560"> 
<table width="100%" border="0" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" role="presentation"> 
<tbody>
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" style="padding: 0px; width: 100%;"> <p height="20" width="100%" style="mso-line-height-rule:exactly; mso-table-lspace:0pt; mso-table-rspace:0pt; text-size-adjust:100%; width: 100%; height: 20px; max-height: 20px; margin: 0px; font-size: 20px; line-height: 20px"> &nbsp; </p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="left" class="aligned-bullets" style="text-align: left; font-family: Chivo, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; color: #223341; font-size: 16px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: normal; line-height: 24px; padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"> <p style="margin: 0px;">Dear {{lead.First Name:default= }},</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">We are excited to announce the launch of Flywire’s Client Resource Centre which is available to all our UK clients!</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong>What’s new?</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><strong>Client Resource Centre:</strong> This centralised hub now houses all essential resources and support options, making it easier for you to find what you need through each quick link. You can access the Client Resource Centre via this <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://help.flywire.com/hc/en-us/p/client_edu_uk?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>direct link here</u></strong></span></a> or through the Extranet (see image below)</li> 
<li><strong>My Support Tickets</strong>: Manage and view all your support interactions in one place, helping you keep track of your inquiries with greater ease. View My Support Tickets <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://help.flywire.com/hc/en-us/requests?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>here</u></strong></span></a></li> 
<li><strong>Virtual Assistant:</strong> Our Virtual Assistant is ready to provide quick, personalised support, offering instant and accurate responses to your queries - you can access it via the Client Resource Centre linked above.</li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong>How to access ‘My Support Tickets’</strong></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><br />The Support Tickets space is password protected and requires a login. To get set up, please follow the steps below:</p> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> 
<ul style="margin-bottom: 0px !important; margin-top: 0px !important;"> 
<li><strong>Step 1:</strong> Enter your work email address and create a password <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://flywiresupport.zendesk.com/auth/v2/login/password_reset?auth_origin=687529%2Ctrue%2Ctrue&amp;brand_id=687529&amp;return_to=https%3A%2F%2Fhelp.flywire.com%2Fhc%2Fen-us%2Frequests&amp;theme=hc&amp;utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign="><span style="color: #48b985;"><strong><u>here</u></strong></span></a> <em>(Continue below for step 2. Note it may take up to 5 minutes for the follow up email to come through.)</em></li> 
<li><strong>Step 2:</strong> Login using the details you set up in step 1, by using this URL: <a style="color: #223341;" href="https://help.flywire.com/hc/en-us/requests?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=">https://help.flywire.com/hc/en-us/requests</a>.</li> 
<li><strong>Step 3:</strong> Once logged in, you’ll see the ‘My Support Tickets’ area. From there you can easily access a number of other quick links.</li> 
</ul> <p style="margin: 0px;">‌<br /></p> <p style="margin: 0px;"><strong>Where to access the Client Resource Centre via the Extranet:</strong></p> </td> 
</tr> 
<tr> 
<td width="100%" valign="top" align="center" class="st-dynamic-509-13" style="padding-bottom: 40px; width: 100%;"><a href="https://extranet-admin.wpmeducation.com/?utm_source=marketo&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_campaign=" target="_blank" style="display: block;"><img border="0" valign="top" width="274" src="https://www.cdnrcad8t.com/9i26uhaos8/en_us/images/668c4a617422b-1720470113.4757.png" alt="WPM Extranet image" title="Image" class="st-hide-mobile st-mobile-width-constraint" style="border: 0px; display: block; width: 274px; max-width: 100%;" /> 
